  <sys:String x:Key="Main_Resume">Resume</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ResumeTip">Goes on with the previous conversion: the files that did not finish or, when only failures are left, the files and pages that failed. It uses the conditions of that conversion. It can be pressed when a file of the list is not done.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_RedoAll">Redo all</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_RedoAllTip">Converts every file of the inputs again with the conditions on the screen. Where a file with an earlier folder is written is chosen on the right (If the folder exists). It can be pressed when the list has files.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_Existing">If the folder exists</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ExistingNew">Make a new one</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ExistingSame">Overwrite</sys:String>
  <sys:String xml:space="preserve" x:Key="Main_ExistingTip">Where Start and Redo all write a file that was converted before.&#10;Make a new one: a new folder such as "name (2)" (the earlier folder stays).&#10;Overwrite: the folder of the earlier conversion (its Markdown and page images are replaced).&#10;Reconvert updated files, Resume and Convert again always write into the earlier folder.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Status_Previous_Done">Showing the previous conversion of the output folder: {0} done. Convert with Reconvert updated files or Redo all.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Status_Previous_Other">The output folder has a conversion of other inputs that did not finish or has failures. To continue it, use File - Open a past output...</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_StartTip">Converts every file of the inputs. It can be pressed when the list of files is empty (the output folder has no earlier conversion).</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ChangedOnly">Reconvert updated files</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ChangedOnlyTip">Converts only the files that changed since their last conversion in the output folder or were never converted. They are written to the folders of their earlier conversion. A change of the conditions alone does not convert a file again. It can be pressed when every file of the list is done.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_Reconvert">Convert the selected files again from Step 1</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ReconvertButton">Convert again from Step 1</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Main_ReconvertTip">Converts the selected files again with the conditions on the screen, into the folders of their earlier conversion (their Markdown and page images are replaced). Ctrl+click or Shift+click selects several files.</sys:String>
